  "{n} employees are not in Million yet: {list}. Create them in Million with exactly these numbers, then import Million's employee list on the month page.": "{n} pekerja belum ada dalam Million: {list}. Cipta mereka dalam Million dengan nombor yang sama, kemudian import senarai pekerja Million di halaman bulan.",
  "From Million's list (same name). Change it if this is another person.": "Daripada senarai Million (nama sama). Tukar jika ini orang lain.",
  "{n} Employee No. was filled in from Million's list, because the name on the card is that employee's whole name there. Check it.": "{n} No. Pekerja diisi daripada senarai Million, kerana nama pada kad sama dengan nama penuh pekerja itu di sana. Sila semak.",
  "{n} Employee Nos. were filled in from Million's list, because the name on the card is that employee's whole name there. Check them.": "{n} No. Pekerja diisi daripada senarai Million, kerana nama pada kad sama dengan nama penuh pekerja itu di sana. Sila semak.",
  "Import employee list from Million": "Import senarai pekerja daripada Million",
  "Employee list from Million: {n} employee, imported on {d}. Import it again after you add an employee in Million.":
    "Senarai pekerja daripada Million: {n} pekerja, diimport pada {d}. Import semula selepas anda menambah pekerja dalam Million.",
  "Employee list from Million: {n} employees, imported on {d}. Import it again after you add an employee in Million.":
    "Senarai pekerja daripada Million: {n} pekerja, diimport pada {d}. Import semula selepas anda menambah pekerja dalam Million.",
  "No employee list from Million yet. In Million Payroll: Employee > Print > Employment Listing > Print > Excel > File. Then import the file rptempepmlist.xls from Million's company folder (for example C:\\million\\Payroll\\mycompany). Table Reader then offers the Employee Nos. and checks them before the Million file is made.":
    "Belum ada senarai pekerja daripada Million. Dalam Million Payroll: Employee > Print > Employment Listing > Print > Excel > File. Kemudian import fail rptempepmlist.xls dari folder syarikat Million (contohnya C:\\million\\Payroll\\mycompany). Table Reader kemudian menawarkan No. Pekerja dan menyemaknya sebelum fail Million dibuat.",
  "Imported {n} employee from Million.": "{n} pekerja diimport daripada Million.",
  "Imported {n} employees from Million.": "{n} pekerja diimport daripada Million.",
  "This is not Million Payroll's employee list. In Million Payroll choose Employee > Print > Employment Listing > Print > Excel > File, then choose the file rptempepmlist.xls here.":
    "Ini bukan senarai pekerja Million Payroll. Dalam Million Payroll pilih Employee > Print > Employment Listing > Print > Excel > File, kemudian pilih fail rptempepmlist.xls di sini.",
  "This file is too large to be Million Payroll's employee list.": "Fail ini terlalu besar untuk menjadi senarai pekerja Million Payroll.",
  "Million file made: {name}. A copy is kept in Documents\\Table Reader\\payroll. Back up Million before you import it. Million only updates employees who are already in that month's payroll (Transaction > Payroll > Edit).":
    "Fail Million siap: {name}. Satu salinan disimpan dalam Documents\\Table Reader\\payroll. Buat sandaran Million sebelum anda mengimportnya. Million hanya mengemas kini pekerja yang sudah ada dalam gaji bulan itu (Transaction > Payroll > Edit).",
  "Pick the month and mark the days, add each employee and tick their time-card files. Table Reader adds up days worked and overtime from the cells you have already checked. Anything it cannot work out is listed, never guessed, and you can type over any figure.":
    "Pilih bulan dan tandakan hari, tambah setiap pekerja dan tandakan fail kad perakam waktu mereka. Table Reader mengira hari bekerja dan kerja lebih masa daripada sel yang telah anda semak. Apa-apa yang tidak dapat dikira akan disenaraikan, tidak sekali-kali diteka, dan anda boleh menaip semula mana-mana angka.",
  "1. Month and days": "1. Bulan dan hari",
  "2. Employees and their time cards": "2. Pekerja dan kad perakam waktu mereka",
  "Add employee": "Tambah pekerja",
  "Add employees from files": "Tambah pekerja daripada fail",
  "for {c}": "untuk {c}",
  "for all companies": "untuk semua syarikat",
  "Choose a company at the top (or “All companies”).": "Pilih syarikat di bahagian atas (atau “Semua syarikat”).",
  "No employees for this company yet. Press “Add employees from files” or “Add employee”.":
    "Belum ada pekerja untuk syarikat ini. Tekan “Tambah pekerja daripada fail” atau “Tambah pekerja”.",
  "One employee is added for each worker in the files, with their time cards ticked. Employee No. is filled in from earlier months; a new worker of a company gets a new one (the company's first 7 letters and a number, like MAJUJAY001) that you can change.":
    "Seorang pekerja ditambah bagi setiap pekerja dalam fail, dengan kad perakam waktu mereka ditandakan. No. Pekerja diisi daripada bulan sebelumnya; pekerja baharu sesebuah syarikat diberi nombor baharu (7 huruf pertama nama syarikat dan satu nombor, seperti MAJUJAY001) yang boleh anda tukar.",
  "New number made by Table Reader. Create this employee in Million with this number before you import.": "Nombor baharu dibuat oleh Table Reader. Cipta pekerja ini dalam Million dengan nombor ini sebelum anda mengimport.",
  "Give {n} employee without an Employee No. a new one": "Beri nombor baharu kepada {n} pekerja tanpa No. Pekerja",
  "Give {n} employees without an Employee No. a new one": "Beri nombor baharu kepada {n} pekerja tanpa No. Pekerja",
  "Give these employees new Employee Nos.? Create them in Million with the same numbers before you import.": "Beri No. Pekerja baharu kepada pekerja ini? Cipta mereka dalam Million dengan nombor yang sama sebelum anda mengimport.",
  "{n} employee without an Employee No. was given a new one (the company's first 7 letters and a number). Create that employee in Million with this number before you import.": "{n} pekerja tanpa No. Pekerja diberi nombor baharu (7 huruf pertama nama syarikat dan satu nombor). Cipta pekerja itu dalam Million dengan nombor ini sebelum anda mengimport.",
  "{n} employees without an Employee No. were given new ones (the company's first 7 letters and a number). Create those employees in Million with these numbers before you import.": "{n} pekerja tanpa No. Pekerja diberi nombor baharu (7 huruf pertama nama syarikat dan satu nombor). Cipta pekerja itu dalam Million dengan nombor ini sebelum anda mengimport.",
  "Added {n} employee.": "{n} pekerja ditambah.", "Added {n} employees.": "{n} pekerja ditambah.",
  "{n} file": "{n} fail", "{n} files": "{n} fail",
  "Added by themselves from newly read files of this month: {list}.":
    "Ditambah dengan sendirinya daripada fail bulan ini yang baru dibaca: {list}.",
  "Newly read files added to: {list}.": "Fail yang baru dibaca ditambah kepada: {list}.",
  "{n} newly read file was not added because Table Reader cannot work out the days from it yet:":
    "{n} fail yang baru dibaca tidak ditambah kerana Table Reader belum dapat mengira hari daripadanya:",
  "{n} newly read files were not added because Table Reader cannot work out the days from them yet:":
    "{n} fail yang baru dibaca tidak ditambah kerana Table Reader belum dapat mengira hari daripadanya:",
